Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790697599999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790639999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 2850 high was not followed by a trend bar: 1790035200000 is an inside bar and 1790121600000 closed 2684.16 below its open, leaving 1790639999999 162 points under the high.", "1787270400000 left a ~256-point upper tail (high 2771 vs close 2515.3), and the following 27 bars could not exceed 2680, showing repeated failure to hold new highs.", "The final four bars are near-doji small-range bars (2636.28-2740.42), a tight two-sided cluster at the trend extreme that fits a final-flag shape rather than trend resumption.", "Two earlier vertical spikes in this window (1787097600000, 1787270400000) were each followed by multi-week ranges, so a stall after the 2850 high is consistent with this window's prior behavior."], "evidence_for": ["Progression of higher swing highs and higher swing lows over the last 40 bars: lows 2357.18 (1788307200000), 2358.62 (1789430400000), 2436.87 (1789689600000) and 2633.31 (1790208000000).", "1789689600000-1789948800000 broke above the 27-bar range and above the prior 2771 spike high, with closes near the highs and acceptance above 2612.02.", "The last seven bars hold entirely above the 2612.02 breakout close and above the 2436.87 breakout-low; no bear bar has closed below a prior bull swing low.", "Buying continued after each consolidation: ranges following the 2293.8/2771 spike highs and after the 27-bar range were all resolved upward."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2006.31 (1780272000000) and sells off to a 1368.42 low (1780704000000) on bars that close near their lows.", "Price then recovers into a long overlapping range around 1710-1975 (e.g. 1692.84 low at 1782000000000 to 1974.46 high at 1785110400000) that persists until 1787011200000.", "1787097600000 is a large bull trend bar (open 1916.51, high 2293.8, close 2252.16), followed by closes of 2326.32 (1787184000000) and 2515.3 with a 2771 high (1787270400000): a three-bar vertical bull spike.", "From 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 the market holds a 27-bar two-sided range between 2357.18 (1788307200000 low) and 2680 (1789084800000 high), repeatedly rejecting 2520-2557 and 2357-2400 with heavy body overlap.", "1789689600000-1789948800000 breaks above that range and above the 2771 spike high: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, with the 2850 high at 1789948800000.", "The new high lacks strong follow-through: 1790035200000 is an inside bar and 1790121600000 closes 2684.16 below its open.", "The last seven bars (1790035200000-1790553600000) are overlapping, with the final four trading 2636.28-2740.42 and 1790639999999 closing 2687.88, roughly mid-range and 162 below the 2850 high."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Multi-month bull swing from the 1368.42 low to the 2850 high, with successively higher swing lows (1512.91, 1533.12, 2357.18, 2436.87, 2633.31) across the supplied window.", "end_time_ms": 1790639999999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780704000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Three-bar vertical bull spike following a long two-sided range: open 1916.51 to close 2252.16 (1787097600000), close 2326.32 (1787184000000), then a 2771 high with a 2515.3 close and a large upper tail (1787270400000).", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Twenty-seven-bar two-sided range after the spike: repeated highs 2520-2557 plus the 2680 spike high at 1789084800000, and repeated lows 2357-2400 with 2357.18 at 1788307200000 and 2358.62 at 1789430400000; no sustained close beyond either edge.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull breakout above the 27-bar range and above the 2771 spike high, closing near highs at 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9 and 2775.61, with the 2850 high printed at 1789948800000.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Tight seven-bar consolidation just under the 2850 high; the last four bars are small overlapping dojis traded between 2636.28 and 2740.42, with no close beyond the 2612.02 breakout close and final close 2687.88.", "end_time_ms": 1790639999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2786.81 and then 2850 on a trend bar with follow-through, and a higher low above 2633.31, would confirm resumption of the bull channel.", "A bear body closing below 2633.31 and then below the 2612.02 breakout close would suggest the breakout has failed and shift the read toward a trading range or transition-unclear.", "A close below 2436.87 would break the most recent bull swing low and question the always-in-long classification.", "Continued overlapping bars contained between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with no boundary close would keep the current read of a bull trend in a breakout-mode tight range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790683199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Counterargument: the pause is a bull flag, not a range top - the structure since 2358.62 keeps higher lows (2358.62 at 1789488000000, 2633.31 at 1790236800000), the floor holds above the 2604 midpoint of the whole 2358.62-2850.00 advance, and the last bar closes at its high.", "Bar 1790668800000 closes 2732.01 at the top of its 2702.09-2732.56 range and above the 2717-2719 resistance cluster, an upside breakout attempt from a tight range, the condition Brooks reads as breakout mode that often resolves with the prior trend.", "Buyers defended 2633-2652 three times (1790236800000 low 2633.31; 1790553600000/1790568000000/1790582400000 lows 2643.44, 2637, 2636.28) and each time price closed back near the range top; no close after 1789502400000 is below 2392.87 and none is below 2633.31."], "evidence_for": ["Roughly 48 H4 bars since the 2850.00 spike high stay inside 2633.31-2804.59 with overlapping bodies and no close above 2804.59, which is trading-range behaviour rather than an ongoing channel.", "Highs step down after the spike: 2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42, 2718.83 - there is no sequence of higher highs, and 2850.00 has not been approached again.", "The 2850.00-to-2633.31 pullback retraces about 59% of the 2486.12-2850.00 leg, deeper than a typical bull-channel pullback, consistent with the spike leg having ended.", "Bars 1790323200000-1790654400000 mostly have sub-40-point ranges with extensive overlap, the two-sided behaviour in which the Always-In direction repeatedly flips.", "The final bar's close 2732.01 remains inside the 2633.31-2740.42 band, so no breakout has yet been accepted by a close above the range top."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2500.02 (bar 1788955200000) and declines to 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000), the lowest low of the 120-bar window; bars 1789416000000-1789502399999 close 2514.07, 2497.77, 2472.88, 2475.01, 2423.29, 2412.95 in sequence.", "Bar 1789128000000 (open 2457.12, high 2680, close 2555.52) is a bull spike bar with a long upper tail; the next 20 bars overlap between 2503.25 and 2609.02.", "Bar 1789416000000 prints high 2609.02 but closes 2514.07, the last high before the drop to 2358.62.", "Bars 1789488000000-1789732799999 build overlapping bodies between 2358.62 and 2482.09; no close after 1789502400000 is below 2392.87.", "Bull leg prints consecutive strong closes 2578.60 (1789732800000) and 2636.28 (1789747200000); bar 1789977600000 opens 2658.81, closes 2723.15 and carries the window high 2850.", "After 1789977600000 no close exceeds 2804.59 and successive highs step down: 2804.59 (1790020800000), 2786.81 (1790136000000), 2740.42 (1790323200000), 2718.83 (1790496000000).", "The 2850.00-to-2633.31 (1790236800000) pullback retraces about 59% of the 2486.12-2850.00 leg.", "Bars 1790323200000-1790654400000 mostly have ranges under about 40 points with heavy overlap; volume on the last 15 bars is 1.9-4.1M versus 8-10M on the earlier spike bars.", "Final bar 1790668800000 opens 2709.26, low 2702.09, closes 2732.01 at its 2732.56 high, above the 2717.27 (1790481600000)/2717.28 (1790654400000)/2718.83 (1790496000000) cluster but below 2740.42."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear leg from the 2609.02 high (bar 1789416000000) into the 2358.62 window low (bar 1789488000000), with the final two bars closing 2423.29 and 2412.95.", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Two-sided base after the low: bars 1789488000000-1789732799999 overlap between 2358.62 and 2482.09 with small bodies and no close below 2392.87 after the first bar.", "end_time_ms": 1789732799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2482.09"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 2486.12 low (bar 1789718400000) to the 2850.00 high (bar 1789977600000), containing spike closes 2578.60 (1789732800000) and 2636.28 (1789747200000) and a final large bar 1789977600000 (open 2658.81, close 2723.15).", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2486.12", "start_time_ms": 1789718400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Large trading range since the 2850.00 high: every close from 1789992000000 to 1790683199999 sits between 2633.31 and 2804.59, with lower highs at 2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42 and 2718.83.", "end_time_ms": 1790683199999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Tight nested trading range/breakout-mode stretch: bars 1790323200000-1790668799999 stay inside 2636.28-2740.42 with heavy overlap, and the final bar 1790668800000 closes 2732.01 at its high above the 2717-2719 cluster but below 2740.42.", "end_time_ms": 1790683199999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2636.28", "start_time_ms": 1790323200000, "upper_boundary": "2740.42"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2740.42 would accept the breakout of the tight range and support reclassifying the pause as a bull flag continuation rather than a range.", "A close back below 2702.09 (the final bar's low) would mark bar 1790668800000 as a failed upside breakout and keep the trading-range read.", "A close below 2633.31 would break the range floor and shift the read toward a bear leg with lower range expansion; the 2643.44-2636.28 shelf is the first intermediate level.", "Continued closes between 2636.28 and 2740.42 with overlapping bars would keep both the trading-range classification and the low Always-In relevance."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2686.28", "close_time_ms": 1790269199999, "high": "2697.65", "low": "2665.97", "open": "2682.25", "open_time_ms": 1790265600000, "volume": "2553300.05"}, {"close": "2668.61", "close_time_ms": 1790272799999, "high": "2687.33", "low": "2666.79", "open": "2686.28", "open_time_ms": 1790269200000, "volume": "1906449.096"}, {"close": "2689.04", "close_time_ms": 17